{"seq":2,"slug":"the-midwifery","title":"The Midwifery","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/the-midwifery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-elenchus","title":"诘问法","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/the-midwifery/the-elenchus","wordCount":1585,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"irony-and-maieutics","title":"反讽与助产","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/ideas-and-methods/the-midwifery/irony-and-maieutics","wordCount":1565,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现苏格拉底独特的探究方法——助产术。诘问法（elenchus）通过追问揭示矛盾，使人陷入困惑，从而打破虚假的自满；反讽与助产，则体现了苏格拉底&quot;引出而非灌输&quot;的精神——他自比助产婆，帮助对话者产出心中本有的思想。本章揭示这一方法所蕴含的深厚人文精神与教育智慧。</p>\n"}